        "original_id": "a4adf138-bbb9-55e4-913d-1928fa9c1880",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Fox, C.S. Lewis, J.R.R. Tolkien\n- Organizations: Inklings, Magdalen College, University of Oxford\n- Roles: Canon, Dean of Divinity\n- Topics: literary discussion groups\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Fox lived from 1883 to 1977.\n- Adam Fox was a Canon and served as the Dean of Divinity at Magdalen College, Oxford.\n- The Inklings was an informal literary discussion group associated with the University of Oxford, England, for nearly two decades from the early 1930s to late 1949.\n- Adam Fox was one of the first members of the Inklings.\n- The Inklings also included C.S. Lewis and J.R.R. Tolkien.",
